WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.778
Squids have a an extremely complex,

00:00:02.778 --> 00:00:04.547
interesting&nbsp;sex life.

00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:06.091
Here you see a male and a female.

00:00:06.091 --> 00:00:08.707
The male, on the left, has been 
fighting&nbsp;off other males

00:00:08.707 --> 00:00:11.388
to pair with the female, and now
 he's showing a dual pattern.

00:00:11.388 --> 00:00:14.623
He shows&nbsp;courtship and love on 
her side, fighting on the other.

00:00:14.623 --> 00:00:16.735
Watch him when she shifts places --

00:00:16.735 --> 00:00:20.226
and you see that he has fluidly 
changed the love-courtship pattern

00:00:20.226 --> 00:00:21.663
to the side of the female.

00:00:21.663 --> 00:00:24.136
So this kind of dual 
signaling simultaneously

00:00:24.136 --> 00:00:27.766
with a changing behavioral context 
is really&nbsp;extraordinary.

00:00:27.766 --> 00:00:29.446
It takes a lot of brain power.

